Package: SensoryToolsR
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Food Sensory Science
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Nga",
        family = "Mai",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "maingats2@gmail.com"
    )
Description: Tools for importing, validating, summarising, analysing, and
    visualising food sensory evaluation data. Provides workflows for
    replicated trained-panel and quantitative descriptive analysis (QDA)
    studies, including panel analysis of variance, assessor performance
    diagnostics, post-hoc comparisons, and principal component analysis.
